## Content Authoring Rules

When updating `src/lib/content/ktu-hub.ts`:

1. Keep `seo.title` ≤ 60 chars and `seo.description` ≤ 160 chars.
2. `seo.h1` must contain ` — ` at least once so the hero splits the title correctly.
3. `offers` bullets must use `"Title — detail"` format so the dark panel auto-splits them into bold title + muted detail. If a bullet has no split, the full string renders as detail (no title).
4. `whyBullets` are plain sentences — no split syntax needed.
5. `branches.href` currently points to the scheme landing page (`/ktu/2024`). Once branch-specific routing exists, update each href to `/ktu/{scheme}/{branch-slug}`.
6. `schemes` must always have exactly 2 entries (2019 and 2024). If KTU introduces a third scheme, add a third `schemeAccents` entry in the component before adding a third scheme object here.
7. Do not put HTML or JSX inside any content string — plain text only.
8. `ctaPhone` must include country code with `+` prefix (e.g. `"+91 98950 09337"`). The component strips spaces and `+` automatically for `wa.me` URLs.

